      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Moment and extreme-value information flow in opposite directions by different mechanisms: a sufficiently rich family of moments, or a usable high moment, constrains pointwise growth, while an RH-conditional pointwise majorant for log|ζ| together with tail-frequency estimates yields upper bounds for moments.",
